{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0FuZGFheiUyMCUyODIwMDMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Andaaz","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xLUQ9NLnn13rujYqbmdoNvv2dmM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hzVQ1bOgrbXgXuoltdDEEO5KFlI.jpg","description":"Young Raj Malhotra lives with his elder brother, Rohit; his sister-in-law Kiran, and a niece. After an accident fractures his leg, he is unable to walk for some time. Due to psychological reasons, he cannot walk even after the fracture heals. When the Malhotras move to Dehra Dun, Raj befriends young Kajal, as both share a common passion for airplanes. Kajal encourages Raj to walk, and succeeds. Years later the two continue to be fast friends, and everyone expects them to marry soon. Then Raj is recruited by the Indian Air Force and goes for training for a year and a half. After his training gets over, he rushes to Kajal to propose to her, only to find out that she has given her heart to a multimillionaire, Karan Singhania (Verma), who owns several airplanes and choppers. Raj congratulates Kajal and Karan, but does not reveal his true feelings.\n\nReleased 23 May 2003 · India · Language: Hindi · 146 min\nStudio: Shree Krishna International\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Drama","Music","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"146 min","cast":["Akshay Kumar","Lara Dutta","Priyanka Chopra Jonas","Rajeev Verma","Pankaj Dheer","Gajendra Chouhan","Vivek Shauq","Vishwajeet Pradhan"],"director":["Raj Kanwar"],"released":"2003-05-23T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"When you love someone express it","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Raj Kanwar","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ncMnNnrzlxb9tkEu0KLaUXzcV7.jpg"},{"name":"Akshay Kumar","character":"Raj Malhotra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sR8nASRtTpiwXqkFHjG2jdRBZ7a.jpg"},{"name":"Lara Dutta","character":"Kajal","photo":"https://ima